WEBVTT

00:01:55.876 --> 00:02:00.156
One million people or thereabouts
became the first in the world

00:02:00.156 --> 00:02:03.876
to commit to being
carbon-neutral for all time.

00:02:03.916 --> 00:02:08.476
Since then, 130 countries of all sizes
have followed suit.

00:02:08.516 --> 00:02:09.756
Or Fiji.

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:14.116
In 2017, it hosted
the UN Climate Conference

00:02:14.116 --> 00:02:18.676
and did so much to highlight
the existential threat

00:02:18.716 --> 00:02:22.356
that climate change poses
to island nations.

00:02:22.356 --> 00:02:26.916
Now, a country like Scotland
with a rich industrial past

00:02:26.956 --> 00:02:29.516
has a special responsibility.

00:02:29.556 --> 00:02:34.196
We have disproportionately
contributed to climate change,